, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">Download it. The MP3 plays on any phone or computer, and once it is saved it needs no internet.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">Send the link to family. Anyone with it can listen, so the same prayer is prayed in more than one house.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">Pray along with the lyrics. Every word is on the page, to read slowly or sing quietly with the chorus.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 22px 0\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"{{ subscriber.prayer_song_link }}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;background:#F2C230;border:1px solid #D9A415;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A1F1A;text-decoration:none;text-align:center\">Open My Song Page</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#5B4A40;\">If the name is not sung right, reply and tell us how it should sound. We will remake the song at no charge.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0 16px 0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:#2A1F1A;font-style:italic\">With our prayers,<br>Sanctoria</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 10px 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9A8B79\">\nSanctoria &middot; <a href=\"https://sanctoriastore.com/prayer-song/\" style=\"color:#9A8B79\">sanctoriastore.com</a> &middot; support@sanctoriastore.com<br>\n{{ inline_postal_address }}<br>\n<a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\" style=\"color:#9A8B79\">Unsubscribe</a>\n</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
