d means it, the prayer is prayed again.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">With it come a keepsake lyric sheet, a nine day prayer companion and a daily prayer card, ready to print.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">It is $39, one time, with no subscription. It arrives by email within 24 hours, usually in about two. If it is not right, one email to support@sanctoriastore.com within 30 days brings a full refund.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">Sample songs can be heard first on our page, sanctoriastore.com/prayer-song.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 22px 0\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"{{ subscriber.prayer_song_resume_link }}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;background:#F2C230;border:1px solid #D9A415;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A1F1A;text-decoration:none;text-align:center\">Finish My Prayer Song</a></td></tr></table>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0 16px 0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:#2A1F1A;font-style:italic\">With our prayers,<br>Sanctoria</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 10px 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9A8B79\">\nSanctoria &middot; <a href=\"https://sanctoriastore.com/prayer-song/\" style=\"color:#9A8B79\">sanctoriastore.com</a> &middot; support@sanctoriastore.com<b