  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light\"><title>Why a sung prayer is prayed again</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#F7F3EC\">\n<div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">The hymns we still know by heart, and what they have to do with a name.&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;&#847;&zwnj;&nbsp;</div>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#F7F3EC\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:28px 14px 36px 14px\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:0 0 22px 0\"><img src=\"https://sanctoriastore.com/images/logo.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"Sanctoria\" style=\"display:block;width:150px;height:auto;border:0\"></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"background:#FFFDF9;border:1px solid #E6DCCA;border-radius:18px;padding:34px 30px 18px 30px\">\n<div style=\"width:38px;height:2px;background:#9A7B4F;margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">{% if subscriber.first_name != blank and subscriber.first_name != subscriber.prayer_song_for %}{{ subscriber.first_name }}, {% endif %}{{ subscriber.prayer_song_for }} was brought to us a week ago, with a prayer and a sound chosen with care. There is something worth saying about why that prayer would be sung.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">Think of a hymn learned as a child. Decades later the words still come back: at a funeral, in the car, over the kitchen sink. A prayer said once is easily lost. A prayer that is sung stays. The Church has always sung what it most wanted to keep.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">Each time the song plays, and someone listens and means it, the prayer for {{ subscriber.prayer_song_for }} is prayed again, in every house the link is sent to.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#2A1F1A;\">One sample can be heard at sanctoriastore.com/prayer-song.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 22px 0\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><a href=\"{{ subscriber.prayer_song_resume_link }}\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;background:#F2C230;border:1px solid #D9A415;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 20px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A1F1A;text-decoration:none;text-align:center\">Finish My Prayer Song</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#5B4A40;\">Your answers are still saved, and the button opens them at the last step.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0 16px 0;font-family:Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;color:#2A1F1A;font-style:italic\">With our prayers,<br>Sanctoria</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:22px 10px 0 10px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9A8B79\">\nSanctoria &middot; <a href=\"https://sanctoriastore.com/prayer-song/\" style=\"color:#9A8B79\">sanctoriastore.com</a> &middot; support@sanctoriastore.com<br>\n{{ i